flowchart LR
    A[Incident Pack\nresolved] --> B[Extract facts\nevidence + impact]
    B --> C[Learning Pack\nproposed]
    C --> D{Human review}
    D -->|missing evidence| E[Blocked\nrepair]
    D -->|approved| F[Versioned learning]
    F --> G[Context Pack\nlearning refs]
    G --> H[Next Plan\nacceptance + scope]
    H --> I[Codex + Verify]
    I --> J[New evidence]
    J --> A
